{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>見到都打冷震!毛毛甜品成新潮流</p><p>泰國最獵奇「毛髪」蛋糕！</p><p>泰國最近興起很獵奇的「毛髮」甜品，原來是由泰國碧差汶府（Phitsanulok）一間Cafe帶起這個熱潮！店家在白色的蛋糕面上，鋪滿黑色可食用髮菜，因外形似「毛髮」，視覺超級衝擊，在網上爆紅，更引起模仿風潮！</p><p>【 每週爆紅話題，「新假期熱話」即時分享最有趣、最矚目社交潮流，如果你想推介獨家故事？DM我哋！】</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178504572139563098_19817007886a65a2da1f23f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178504572409831428_18924477196a65a2dc8f339.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178504572592378109_12436020976a65a2de4f822.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178504572783253624_14687122126a65a2e03f400.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178504572978825012_9573609936a65a2e23bf35.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178504573178381700_4554244636a65a2e438352.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T06:18:36.689556+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}